== Logical Plan ==
Project: [#region, #orders, #revenue]
  Aggregate: group=[#region] aggr=[COUNT(*) AS orders, SUM(#amount) AS revenue]
    Filter: (#amount > 10)
      Scan: sales

== Optimized Logical Plan ==
Aggregate: group=[#region] aggr=[COUNT(*) AS orders, SUM(#amount) AS revenue]
  Scan: sales filters=[(#amount > 10)]

== Physical Plan ==
HashAggregateExec#0: group=[#region] aggr=[COUNT(*) AS orders, SUM(#amount) AS revenue]
  Parquet/Csv/MemoryScanExec#1: sales partitions=1 projection=None filters=[(#amount > 10)]
